  "limitations": [
    "Original complete exterior reconstruction from two inspected ordinary photos and exact retained OSM/Q844324 footprint with standard viewer PMTiles/global terrain. This is845 United Nations Plaza,not Fifth Avenue Trump Tower. No downloaded mesh,private photo texture,bespoke survey or archival research. Interiors,individual apartment curtains/furnishings,exact façade inventory,street furniture and surrounding buildings are outside scope.",
    "Main tower bounds45.196m by24.569m follow the retained rectangular footprint;the narrower eastern25.411m-wide entrance projection expands the mapped width to30.894m. Height262m follows the retained fact,versus260m generalized PMTiles part. The +Z/ESE gold canopy and entrance face United Nations Plaza/First Avenue. Pane/floor counts,window tint/reflectance,roof plant,canopy coffers,sign lettering,doors and stairs are approximate original reconstructions,not an engineering schedule.",
    "Detailed source preserves individual panes,recess returns,fine mullion relief,coffered gold canopy,original geometric sign/845 address,two revolving-door assemblies,side doors and stair rails. Four browser tiers simplify that detail. Skyline uses a tinted whole tower and canopy;district uses shared window ribbons;street aggregates vertical panes;close-up restores80 reconstructed rows,physical door apertures,canopy/sign and roof plant. Opaque shared patterned glass approximates glazing;no optical interiors or transparency claim.",
    "Four existing256px shared graphs provide window grid,painted-metal mullions,bronze/gold trim and granite foundation. Colors supply the bronze and gold palette;the rough bronze graph is an approximation for polished entrance trim. No private or embedded images. The source master is separate from browser tiers;far tiers aggregate ground-floor door openings and roof details.",
    "Unmodified129x129/1.5m standard global terrain grid oversamples one coarse native urban tile. Base10m comes from the retained map elevation and remains approximate. Native ground at the perimeter is roughly8–9m;foundation skirt embeds below it and the stair end samples the native field. Actual curb,foundation,accessibility and entry gradients are not surveyed. Estimated tier errors4/2/1/.4m are not certified mesh distances;physical laptop/phone and dense-city timing remain unmeasured."
  ],
